OL,3,GNEWSACycle lane plans a waste of money,
OL,4,Asays MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on Sheffield City
OL,7,FCouncil to scrap part of a major
OL,8,Fregeneration scheme, describing it as a
OL,9,F"complete waste of money".
OL,11,FWork to improve access between Darnall
OL,12,Fand Attercliffe into the city centre
OL,13,Fand Meadowhall started in February, in
OL,14,Fa scheme called Connecting Sheffield.
OL,15,FIt will include cycle lanes as well as
OL,16,Fnew crossing points and red lines
OL,17,Fprohibiting parking.
OL,19,FClive Betts, Labour MP for Sheffield
OL,20,FSouth East, said part of the project in
OL,21,FAttercliffe had caused businesses to
OL,22,Flose customers on a "grand scale".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
